    "updated_at": "2026-11-19T20:51:23Z",
    "body": "Post-merge run 44596948231 at `e048b103c` is green. That commit contains the merge `56c5a35e4`. The step `ui suites: egui_app` passed there.\n\nThus main is not red, and the SIGSEGV of run 44591582241 is intermittent. The cause is not known.\n\nChanges to this issue:\n- The title now names the fault, because main is green.\n- The priority goes from `P2` to `P3`: no gate on main is red at this time. Raise it to `P1` if the cause is in product code.\n\nThe work that stays: run the `egui_app` test binary many times on Linux, find the test that stops with the signal, and find the cause.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
