    "updated_at": "2026-11-19T23:45:59Z",
    "body": "One more occurrence, in a different UI test binary.\n\n- Where: a local quick gate in a worktree, for PR #2842, on Linux. The base is `main` at `3970d3d03`.\n- Step: `ui suites: lib` (`cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- --test-threads=6`).\n- Result: the test binary stopped with `signal: 11, SIGSEGV: invalid memory reference` after 3 s. No test reported a failure. The last test that printed `ok` was `egui_app::report_tests::the_body_carries_the_questions_and_the_debug_report`.\n- The same step ran again alone with no code change. It was green in 205 s.\n\nPR #2842 adds one checkbox row to the Lead in / Lead out tab. This run does not show whether that change is related to the signal.\n",
